'''Li'l Gau''' (ガウガウ gaugau, '''Gaugau''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 1.4 Update|Version 1.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Li'l Gau
|image = E 026.png
|appearance = [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,200¢ - 4,740¢
}}

==Enemy==
An enemy with low health, damage, range and overall pitiful stats. This enemy serves no threat at all despite having Area Attack, and it can easily be defeated with anything the player has.

==Strategy==
Use anything to kill it and it will most likely die in one hit anyways.

